[D][G]the [D][Em]voice [Am][D7]of [C][D7]prayer [G][D7]is [Em][A]never [A7][D]silent,
[D][G]nor [D][Em]die [Am][D7]the [C][G]strains [D7][Em]of [G][Am]praise [D7][G]away.

Verse 4:
[D][G]So [D][Em]be [Am][D7]it, [C]Lord; [D7][G]Thy [D7][Em]throne [A][A7]shall [D]never,
[D][G][D]like [Em][Am]earth's [D7][C]proud [G][D7][Em]empires, [G][Am]pass [D7][G]away.
